    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">You find it very easy to coil and spring from branches or high places. You gain your choice of the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.HJYQlmGTdtyGWr6a]{Powerful Leap} or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.63sSYk5yqiAyZGb9]{Graceful Leaper} skill feats. If you have both feats, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.2HJ4yuEFY1Cast4h]{High Jumps} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.JUvAvruz7yRQXfz2]{Long Jumps}.</span></p>"
